    <text>PP : Primary Pump
TP : Turbomolecular pump
PV : Primary Valve
TP : Turbomolecular Valve
SV : Secondary Valve



AIV : Air Input Valve
NIV : Nitrogen Input Valve
LTV : Leak Test Valve

PGTP : Primary Gauge Turbo Pump
SGTP : Secondary Gauge Turbo Pump
PGVC : Primary Gauge Vacuum Chamber
SGVC : Secondary Gauge Vacuum Chamber


SV Forcing : In case of problem it could be necessary to force the opening of at least one SV (secondary Valve). In this case the validation of the SV Forcing button will send to the PLC an information to tell : " Please let me Open SV !"

When you have solve all the problems you must deselect the SV Forcing condition.</text>
